OL,3,GNEWSAHead warns school cannot handle
OL,4,Aplan for new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher is warning hundreds of
OL,7,Fparents that building a new housing
OL,8,Festate next to her high school will
OL,9,Fcreate "unsustainable strain" on its
OL,10,Fresources.
OL,12,FHelen Watts, executive principal of
OL,13,FAcle Academy, in Norfolk, which has
OL,14,Fmore than 700 pupils, said it could not
OL,15,Faccommodate more children.
OL,17,FNorfolk Homes is consulting on plans to
OL,18,Fbuild 135 properties off South Walsham
OL,19,FRoad.
